Subject: client-runtime: Baton's RPC group on the client protocol

The fabric.* group rides the same socket, and its work-session stream is a subscription tag.

diff --git a/packages/client-runtime/src/rpc/client.ts b/packages/client-runtime/src/rpc/client.ts
